xt": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tSo, Peter, tell me about Camilla. Why didn't it work out in the end?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI never said that we went out together! We were just good friends in college.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tSo why did you say she was your soulmate? It sounds like the two of you were confused about your feelings.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI only found out she had a crush on me after Sally and Vanessa pointed out that it was pretty obvious. I guess I didn't see it at the time."}, {"time": "23000", "image": "engenn8le01ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tOh, Peter! It feels like you've been thinking a lot about this.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tOf course I have. I've been so unlucky with my dates lately. In fact, I've been trying to get in touch with Camilla recently. I wish I was brave enough to call her.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tWhy don't you? It sounds to me like she cares a lot about you. I wish you were a bit more proactive about this!"}, {"time": "45000", "image": "engenn8le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tTrust me, I've tried. I just feel anxious whenever I know I have to call someone. I wish I could be more like my friend Mike. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tHave you asked him for advice? It feels like you could learn a lot from him.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tHe's been giving me pointers, of course. I guess I'm just a boring nerd.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tDon't say that! You're special in your own way. I wish someone realized that.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tThanks. Maybe I should just get over the whole dating thing ..."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}